<view class="page data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="content data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="notice data-v-0e9c7d0f">规则修改后将影响新产生的数据，历史已发放积分不追溯变更。</view><view class="card rules-card data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="card-title data-v-0e9c7d0f">积分获取规则</view><view class="rule-form data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="data-v-0e9c7d0f">单次有效邀请积分</view><text class="data-v-0e9c7d0f">好友首次注册并绑定手机号后发放</text></view><view class="num-input data-v-0e9c7d0f"><input class="data-v-0e9c7d0f" value="1" type="number"/><text class="data-v-0e9c7d0f">分</text></view></view><view class="rule-form data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="data-v-0e9c7d0f">积分有效期</view><text class="data-v-0e9c7d0f">从积分发放之日起计算</text></view><view class="num-input data-v-0e9c7d0f"><input class="data-v-0e9c7d0f" value="365" type="number"/><text class="data-v-0e9c7d0f">天</text></view></view></view><view class="card data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="card-title data-v-0e9c7d0f">泰山游兑换规则</view><view wx:for="{{a}}" wx:for-item="r" wx:key="e" class="rule-form data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="data-v-0e9c7d0f">{{r.a}}</view><text class="data-v-0e9c7d0f">{{r.b}}</text></view><view class="num-input data-v-0e9c7d0f"><input class="data-v-0e9c7d0f" value="{{r.c}}" type="number"/><text class="data-v-0e9c7d0f">{{r.d}}</text></view></view></view><view class="card data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="title-row data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="data-v-0e9c7d0f"><view class="data-v-0e9c7d0f">规则启用状态</view><view class="sub data-v-0e9c7d0f">关闭后暂停发放与兑换</view></view><switch class="data-v-0e9c7d0f" checked color="#12a594"/></view></view><view class="btn btn-primary data-v-0e9c7d0f" bindtap="{{b}}">保存配置</view></view></view>